# LaTeX build artefacts (docs/thesis). Everything here is regenerated by
# pdflatex/bibtex; only sources are tracked. minitoc and glossaries emit the
# less obvious ones (.mlf*/.mlt*/.maf/.mtc*, .xdy/.glo/.gls/.ist).
